---

<Layout>
    <Navbar></Navbar>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Hi!!</h1>
            <p class="about">
            So, as I'm sure you read from the first page, I'm a<br>
            mainly backend hobbyist software developer who's trying to get into engineering.<br>
            I also play electric guitar (favorite band is kglw).<br>
            <br>
            I'm just gonna rapid fire some stuff about me and my setup.<br>
            <br>
            I'm currently running gentoo on my main pc, and I actually just switched off of bin pkgs today.<br>
            My PC specs are 32GB of DDR4 RAM, a Ryzen 5 5500, and a Radeon RX 9060 XT<br>
            I'm currently using a Tofu60 Redux with Kailh Box Jades for a keyboard, though I own a custom<br>
            built Totem (that I hand soldered) and a Kinesis Advantage 360.<br>
            I have a Endgame Gear OP1 8k v2 for my mouse, and a 24 inch 144hz LG monitor, which I'm considering upgrading<br>
            to a 1440p 240hz OLED.<br>
            <br>
            I'm using Hyprland as my WM and noctalia shell as the bar. My terminal of choice is ghostty, and my editor is neovim.<br>
